    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight and lead the offensive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frontline Command is an intense auto-battler roguelite that challenges you to build and manage your squad in tactical combat. Set in a war-torn world, you control a team of elite troopers, each with unique weapons and skills that can be enhanced through strategic synergies. The game offers diverse gameplay with over 25 unique units and\u00a0 countless upgrades that allow you to craft the perfect army and adapt to ever-changing battle conditions. As you progress, you'll face increasingly difficult enemies, testing your tactical prowess and decision-making.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Unique Generals and Units</strong>: Choose from five different generals, each with distinct playstyles, and use more than different 25 units to fit your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Roguelite Replayability</strong>: Every battle is different, with procedural generation of enemy forces and strategic relics to keep each run fresh and exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Strategic Depth</strong>: Perfect your tactics with a variety of unit combinations, leveraging synergies and powerful relics to defeat increasingly challenging enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is perfect for fans of auto-battlers and roguelites looking for an engaging challenge with endless replayability. Build your strategy, test your limits, and see if you can lead your troops to victory!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight and lead the offensive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frontline Command is an intense auto-battler roguelite that challenges you to build and manage your squad in tactical combat. Set in a war-torn world, you control a team of elite troopers, each with unique weapons and skills that can be enhanced through strategic synergies. The game offers diverse gameplay with over 25 unique units and\u00a0 countless upgrades that allow you to craft the perfect army and adapt to ever-changing battle conditions. As you progress, you'll face increasingly difficult enemies, testing your tactical prowess and decision-making.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Unique Generals and Units</strong>: Choose from five different generals, each with distinct playstyles, and use more than different 25 units to fit your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Roguelite Replayability</strong>: Every battle is different, with procedural generation of enemy forces and strategic relics to keep each run fresh and exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Strategic Depth</strong>: Perfect your tactics with a variety of unit combinations, leveraging synergies and powerful relics to defeat increasingly challenging enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is perfect for fans of auto-battlers and roguelites looking for an engaging challenge with endless replayability. Build your strategy, test your limits, and see if you can lead your troops to victory!</p>",
